{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_title", "source_sha256": "0e8849ddba71da78e9a415a806ac2653b323f19683a38b10c2fc421be0544d5c", "ja": "劇場内に新しい設備が……！？", "zh": "剧场内有了新设施……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f5e628231ebde5c69b0886680336986a04b2817b5087fbaf469971ee1fc5eeaf", "ja": "劇場内に写真撮影スタジオが完成！\n新たな可能性の広がりに胸躍らせる、\nアイドル達の一幕です。", "zh": "剧场内的照片拍摄摄影棚建成了！\n这是偶像们因新可能性的拓展而心潮澎湃的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "29dfbc1d3e434affb581af4b611e2afe5c9ec5a69b911b16b6e69c45a9211950", "ja": "みんな、喜んでくれ！　この劇場の中に、\nみんなのための、写真撮影スタジオが出来たんだ！", "zh": "大家快高兴起来吧！剧场里建成了一个属于大家的摄影棚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "d9df7f3f936d2def5ca329eb47947786ad416362f629e6b06c44ba03a112dc57", "ja": "え？　あの工事ってそうだったんだ？\nやったぁ！　たくさんお昼寝できそうなの～♪", "zh": "诶？原来之前的施工是为了这个呀？\n太好了！感觉可以睡好多午觉了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "0ee49508e8f33bd09d2681195665e7038d29a508631c7d0b74cde3077eb0319f", "ja": "ロコはアトリエかと思ってましたが、スタジオでも\n大丈夫ですよ。ロコアートがはかどりそうです♪", "zh": "我还以为ROCO是画室，不过是工作室也没关系哦。ROCO的艺术创作看来会进展得很顺利♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "d07cf49ee3d11eaef1ae787589bd6e3c149addf2de22b41e1bdbb0e3ff6bbb64", "ja": "ナイショのお鍋パーティーにもピッタリですね♪\n{$P$}さんは糸コンニャク派ですか？", "zh": "也很适合举办秘密火锅派对呢♪\n{$P$}先生是魔芋丝派吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "05b54d5ed434d71ad06b34940d9bb9ea3c968860d00b0c29643a9a0e084e5d70", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}！\n私達の、いろんな可能性が広がりそうです！", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}！\n感觉我们的各种可能性都能拓宽了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ecc9aa18947d7f2ff1066c37e5f147faaba145cd612d39864c14484280c752b9", "ja": "……一応いっておくけど、写真を撮る部屋だからな？\nほら、専用の高性能カメラも導入したんだ。", "zh": "……我先说好，这里可是拍照用的房间哦？\n你看，还特意引进了专用的高性能相机呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7e8e525f441ba9b122d09a12311b0e25fb2cbd61e84f6d18cd7289731744a025", "ja": "これで、これからはみんなの写真を、いつでも気軽に\n撮れるようになった。楽しみにしててくれよ！", "zh": "这样一来，以后就能随时轻松地给大家拍照了。敬请期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "a8ced96b175ca4edd42ef381bbcf6535c4b685fc24f6cc5c8352abb5e828d1fb", "ja": "そうですね、本当にいつでも……あっ。\nでも、カメラマンさんがいない時は、無理ですよね？", "zh": "是啊，这样一来，以后就能随时轻松地给大家拍照了……啊。不过，摄影师不在的时候，还是没办法吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "447596ac7bcdc3bef27e0fb822e23299238808bf295e3b01b106310c20bff026", "ja": "もちろん、ちゃんとした写真はな。\nでもちょっとした写真なら、俺が撮ればいいかなって。", "zh": "当然，像样的照片嘛……不过要是随手拍的照片，我来拍就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "5f22bf7f77974667c352dc0b9638a94b7e95b07bff871f787d5ee89c93d1ddc6", "ja": "わぁ、撮りデューサーさんですね！　素敵です♪\nこれから私たちの写真、たくさん撮ってくださいねっ。", "zh": "哇，是摄影制作人先生呢！真棒♪\n今后请多给我们拍些照片哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "614a1d5875447ba3d1e6a46be5638ad4be7c71bcbcfe1b2d52769bc2dbee1b1b", "ja": "あはっ。{$P$}のオーダーなら、\nミキ、どんなポーズでもOKってカンジ……♪", "zh": "啊哈。只要是{$P$}的要求，\n美希感觉摆什么姿势都没问题哦……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "eeeed0eae368cbcf81d66681e09d5768054409cc8bd9409e3768d20bcb267f10", "ja": "でも大丈夫ですか？　ロコは{$P$}の\nグラフィックセンスを信用してますけど～。", "zh": "不过，没问题吗？ROCO可是很信任{$P$}的美术设计品味哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "f9ed9de37a745f99e4768fb197d95764b1618a73dac4d6fe80841f0c85f81b0d", "ja": "いいフォトグラフを撮るには、やっぱり、\n十分なエクスペリエンスが必要だって思います！", "zh": "想要拍出好的摄影作品，果然还是需要\n充足的经验呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "abe66f903e75728b3e4a4e6619fc29e37dc1d9ff78d894bf9acfcbd6861e00ec", "ja": "ま、まあ、それはそうだと思うよ。\nだから、その辺はおいおい……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯，我也觉得是这样。\n所以，那方面就慢慢来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "d37c13078b720a4be143c5e25d8b8ca8f4a74ffb5cb7c33fb98c048f1cfdb85e", "ja": "そうだよロコちゃん。{$P$}には、\nこれからたくさん、私達を撮ってもらえばいいと思う！", "zh": "对啊，ROCO。我觉得接下来让{$P$}多给我们拍些照片就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "131cbad9b416682e8f9ea2b66366ed95fdd522062d1aa93b2c4222e8e2ddbd2d", "ja": "そうそう。そうすればみんなも、\nモデルの練習になるだろ？", "zh": "对对。这样一来，大家也能练习当模特了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "7d32d5db4cfc52df9145b4ca8a1a2bf4eca371dbba49a3d01a486e614f6596c3", "ja": "なるほど……。さすが{$P$}、\nグッドアイディアです♪", "zh": "原来如此……不愧是{$P$}，真是个好主意♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "f45a1d1454001d0045134d1b22b231580d41a999aeaf41e06ee7aa4b8bb609f7", "ja": "ふふっ、じゃあ撮り撮りデューサーさんですね♪\nいろんな私たちを、撮り撮りしちゃってください♪", "zh": "呵呵，那就叫您“拍拍制作人”先生啦♪  \n请把各种各样的我们，都拍下来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "b802e2d60bfc5014ba4d4a47d2f3c04c2cce81f219f2496dc0a2108dea71e356", "ja": "撮影の時は、二人っきりだよね？\nあはっ、ミキ、すっごく楽しみにしてる☆", "zh": "拍摄的时候，就只有我们两个人了吧？\n啊哈，美希超级期待的哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "ee08a5a160d2174f2760bb47b620dbdb5786a21425b9cb22619d01721bdf61a5", "ja": "スタジオって、もう入っていいんですよね？\n私、みんなを呼んできます！", "zh": "已经可以进摄影棚了吧？\n我去把大家叫来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "4b81d83ef537737b49245bb01d69ce9b8c1abee0b5b866a5309987d2695306c1", "ja": "ロコもクオリティチェックがしたいです！\n{$P$}、カギは開いてますか？", "zh": "ROCO也想做质量检查！\n{$P$}先生，门锁开了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3c1ebd53a1e69e596ea3d4689496efe702bea84f6f6af53aa28038ce8592d3f8", "ja": "そんな慌てなくても、いつでも使えるんだけどな。\nでもせっかくだし、みんなで一緒に見に行くか！", "zh": "不用这么着急，随时都能用的。  \n不过难得有这个机会，大家一起去看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_640_so_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_640_so_01_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "3ecdf41bd20ae8e8b216aa7c95286cb1ecb6d1fccacc53cadb8116244604b017", "ja": "はーい、なの☆", "zh": "好哒☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
